{
  "declaredLength": 9272,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Les propositions B et C sont pas mal, mais soyons\nsérieux... La proposition A est la meilleure !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma proposition, la B, est clairement au-dessus !\nElle a bien plus d’impact que les vôtres !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il est évident que la C est supérieure,\nmais vous n’avez pas l’air de me croire...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Que diriez-vous de demander son avis\nà ce<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̀tte jeune <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЄhommfille ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est une bonne idée ! Nous tournons en rond\ndepuis tout à l’heure...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200075006E006500200062006F006E006E006500200069006400E90065002000210020004E006F0075007300200074006F00750072006E006F006E007300200065006E00200072006F006E0064000A00640065007000750069007300200074006F00750074002000E00020006C201900680065007500720065002E002E002E00100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé, jeune <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЄhommfille !\nTu veux bien venir nous aider ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E9002C0020006A00650075006E0065002000100003110000FF04040068006F006D006D00660069006C006C006500200021000A00540075002000760065007500780020006200690065006E002000760065006E006900720020006E006F007500730020006100690064006500720020003F00100002011401B40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu vois cette rue ? Elle est plutôt sympa,\nmais on pense qu’elle manque de charme...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Du coup, on voudrait lui trouver un nouveau nom\npour qu’elle attire un peu plus l’attention.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et donc, on aimerait avoir ton avis sur la question.\nOn compte sur toi, l’avenir de cette rue est en jeu !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voici les noms que nous avons en tête...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0069006300690020006C006500730020006E006F006D007300200071007500650020006E006F00750073002000610076006F006E007300200065006E0020007400EA00740065002E002E002E00100002011401B20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Proposition A : l’<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Avenue des Champs d’Illumis<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl faut lui donner un nom pompeux et grandiose\npour susciter la curiosité des passants !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 151
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Proposition B : la <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Rue de la Méga-Évolution<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBon, elle n’a rien à voir avec la Méga-Évolution,\nmais c’est mon idée, elle est forcément bonne !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 158
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Proposition C : l’<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Allée Comungan<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nÇa lui va comme un gant !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On a de bonnes idées, tu trouves pas ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais voilà, on arrive pas à se décider !\nC’est pire que de choisir entre Eau, Feu et Plante !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nTu dois savoir ce que ça fait, toi, non ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 185
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, quelle proposition préfères-tu ?\nDonne-nous ton avis !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƳ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F00720073002C0020007100750065006C006C0065002000700072006F0070006F0073006900740069006F006E00200070007200E9006600E8007200650073002D007400750020003F000A0044006F006E006E0065002D006E006F0075007300200074006F006E002000610076006900730020002100100002011401B30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, as-tu choisi un nom parmi\nnos propositions ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƲ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3484,
